# The SQL service's settings — DuckDB in a process of its own.
#
# Loaded by docker-compose.lean.yml as the sql service's env_file. The service
# needs NO configuration to serve: it listens on its container port (8080,
# baked into the image) and holds no state — every query is one in-memory
# instance, thrown away (isolation is structural). This file exists so the
# compose `env_file` per service has one committed, discoverable example.
